--------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. CONCEPT WORK — retained by its creator
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Applies to every concept submitted to the project: images, video, audio,
3D work, the contents of concepts/, and anything else contributed as part
of a concept.

Creators keep full ownership of their own work. Submitting a concept grants
this project a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to display,
reproduce and distribute that work as part of the WE ARE DESTINY 3 website,
repository, and non-commercial promotion of the project, with attribution to
the creator. Nothing else is granted or implied, and a creator may ask for
their work to be removed at any time by opening an issue.

Unless a creator states otherwise on their own entry, concept work in this
repository is offered to the public under:

    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
    (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

In short: reuse and remix it, credit the creator, share it under the same
terms, and don't sell it.

A creator may license their own entry more permissively by saying so in the
entry's description or in an accompanying file. Their statement wins for
their work.

