3. FAN PROJECT NOTICE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

WE ARE DESTINY 3 is an unofficial, non-commercial community fan project. It
is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or associated with Bungie,
Inc.

"Destiny", "Destiny 2", and related names, characters, logos, imagery and
trademarks are the property of their respective owners. No claim of ownership
over them is made here, and none of the licences above extend to them.

Concepts published here are speculative work created by individual community
members. They are not Bungie material, not leaked material, and not a
prediction of any real product.

Rights holders with a concern about any material in this repository can open
an issue or contact the maintainer, and it will be addressed promptly.
